1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,421
A system can be open, like tea in an open cup: steam, which is matter, and heat both escape.

2
00:00:07,421 --> 00:00:13,502
Closed, like a reaction in a sealed glass bulb: heat can cross, matter cannot.

3
00:00:13,502 --> 00:00:19,570
Or isolated, like hot water in a perfect thermos flask: nothing crosses at all.

